# Cloudflare Pages redirects - generated by scripts/generate-redirects.mjs
# Do not edit by hand; edit the generator and re-run it.
#
# The 2026-10-08 migration moved the static tool pages under /tools/<slug> and
# then onto the TanStack Start app. The old top-level URLs are still linked
# from outside, so they need permanent redirects.
#
# NOTE: this build emits a `_worker.js`. Cloudflare hands requests to that
# worker and does not consult this file, so the same rules are compiled into
# src/generated/redirects.ts and applied by src/lib/legacy-redirect.ts in
# src/server.ts. This file is kept in sync for the case where the project is
# ever served as static output.

